  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dd46f4c48ea13f644b49af6b289fdb82, type: 3}
  m_Name: Friend2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueSequence:
  - text: Is this one of your friends at school?
    displayText: Is this one of your friends at school?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls:
    - index: 0
      functionType: 4
      parameter:
      - Room2 Pic3 OnScreen
    - index: 0
      functionType: 6
      parameter:
      - Room2 Pic3 OnScreen
      - 1
  - text: Yes.$.$. $$She was weird though. $$I'm quite uncomfortable with her around.
    displayText: Yes... She was weird though. I'm quite uncomfortable with her around.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 040000000500000007000000070000001d0000001d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: How? $$She doesn't look weird in this picture?
    displayText: How? She doesn't look weird in this picture?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0500000005000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: One day, $$I was eating, $$and she and her friend group just decided they'd
      talk to me. $$And so they sit down opposite of me and start talking.
    displayText: One day, I was eating, and she and her friend group just decided
      they'd talk to me. And so they sit down opposite of me and start talking.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 090000000900000017000000170000005400000054000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: And you don't want to talk to her group, $$Rika?
    displayText: And you don't want to talk to her group, Rika?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2900000029000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Don't think of me like that. $$I don't have social anxiety, $$you know?
      $$It's just like.$.$. $$she's harassing me.
    displayText: Don't think of me like that. I don't have social anxiety, you know?
      It's just like... she's harassing me.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1d0000001d0000003a0000003a000000440000004400000053000000540000005600000056000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Harassing? $$That much? $$Au.$.$. $$You've no luck in finding friends,
      $$huh?
    displayText: Harassing? That much? Au... You've no luck in finding friends, huh?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4ec1ce6e63321a941829a1566caac4f2, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0b0000000b0000001600000016000000190000001a0000001c0000001c0000003f0000003f000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Who in the world starts a conversation with a dirty joke? $$And why are
      they so insistent on asking me if I have a crush on someone?
    displayText: Who in the world starts a conversation with a dirty joke? And why
      are they so insistent on asking me if I have a crush on someone?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 3a0000003a000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: And to make it worse, $$the group pressure discourages me from walking
      out of it too.
    displayText: And to make it worse, the group pressure discourages me from walking
      out of it too.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1600000016000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: That's like.$.$. $$a new form of sexual harassment.$.$.?
    displayText: That's like... a new form of sexual harassment...?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0c0000000d0000000f0000000f0000002f00000030000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: You can call it whatever you want, $$but almost everyone in school is like
      that, $$and it makes my life unhappy.
    displayText: You can call it whatever you want, but almost everyone in school
      is like that, and it makes my life unhappy.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dd7424e912b1ed242be9b05b9e0c8d66, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 23000000230000004f0000004f000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: But anyway, $$I found a jigsaw behind the portrait here. $$Let's go.
    displayText: But anyway, I found a jigsaw behind the portrait here. Let's go.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0c0000000c0000003700000037000000
    functionCalls:
    - index: 0
      functionType: 7
      parameter:
      - Room2 Pic3 OnScreen
      - 1
  - text: 
    displayText: But anyway, I found a jigsaw behind the portrait here. Let's go.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
